  "content": "<div>给大家看一词，这个品牌词有那么高的搜索量，惊呆我了。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/ry992bn1vt_img1.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/ry992bn1vt_img2.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>cricbuzz.com 月访问量3.46亿。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/ry992bn1vt_img3.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>怎么发现这个词的？ 谷歌Ads关键字规划工具-&gt;关键词预测，随便输入自己感兴趣的关键词，按照搜索量从高到低，一个一个关键词去看，然后你就能打开新世界。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/ry992bn1vt_img4.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>同理，你输入 game ，就能够看到游戏相关的关键词，不仅仅可以看到关键词里带了“game”的，也可以看到其他相关关键词。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/ry992bn1vt_img5.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/ry992bn1vt_img6.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>然后你就能看到一些不错的站点。</div>",
